        <text>
          <content>
            <paragraph align="center">○<index num="0030590_0" ref="M_0008916" sort="A" sort2="明" type="이름">馮謹</index>還, <index num="0030591_0" ref="M_0033550" sort="K" type="이름">鄭昇</index>、<index num="0030592_0" ref="M_0062364" sort="K" type="이름">金角</index>等六人, 各歸鄕貫省親, 上出餞于<index num="0030593_0" sort="K" type="지명">崇禮門</index>外。 上贈<index num="0030594_0" ref="M_0008916" sort="A" type="이름">謹</index>苧麻布, <index num="0030595_0" ref="M_0008916" sort="A" type="이름">謹</index>辭不受, 潛語通事曰: "予有佛堂, 何以得石燈盞?" 上知其意, 乃贈四事。</paragraph>
